  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『機動戦士ガンダム SEED FREEDOM』でも複数機で活躍！専用パーツの差替えによりMA形態への変形も再現したオーブの量産型可変MSが商品化！",
      "en": "Also active in multiple aircraft in \"Mobile Suit Gundam SEED FREEDOM\"! Orb's mass-produced variable MS that reproduces the transformation to MA form by replacing special parts has been commercialized!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 戦闘機状態のシルエットを美しく表現するため、変形機構をオミットしパーツ差替えでMA形態のフォルムを再現。",
      "en": "• In order to beautifully express the silhouette of the fighter plane, the deformation mechanism has been removed and the MA form has been reproduced by replacing parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ビームライフルのフォアグリップは収納・展開が可能。MA形態時にはライフルを主翼に接続することができる。",
      "en": "• The beam rifle's foregrip can be stored and expanded. When in MA mode, the rifle can be connected to the main wing."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 全身の差し色をはじめ、頭部の色分けなどはパーツ分割で細部まで再現。",
      "en": "• The coloring of the whole body and the color-coding of the head are reproduced in detail by dividing the parts."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 複数機を揃えることで、編隊を組んだ作戦行動を再現することも可能。",
      "en": "• By arranging multiple aircraft, it is also possible to reproduce operations in formation."
    }
  ],
